Z||000013||pHoOl||06-18-2001||10:33 PM||||Can we just let this one die before we get more people pissed off at this board than there already are?  <P>You ask her why she likes the car... first off, we all know that the fiero is beautiful, so why wouldn't she?  And yes, most girls (typical ones maybe?) don't like the car "because they think thier gonna gt hurt in it, or get run over by a truck".  But, so does every single guy that i've talked to.  They always tell me that i'm riding in a death trap and that it's gonna catch on fire.  <P>Eric, i'm not meaning to start a flame war, i just kinda realized that it might sound like that.  Trust me, i'm not.  just trying to explain things before $hit hits the fan.  <P>Have a nice day everybody, i'm gonna sit back and enjoy the BBQ.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
