Z||000037||Fierochic88||06-19-2001||10:01 PM||||Hey there.  Welcome to the forum!  I'll have pics up soon, hopefully tomorrow (if I remember to upload the disk at work!).  As far as what got me interested.  Interested in cars?  A car obsessed ex boyfriend.  Interested in Fieros?  My dad when he won his in 1985 (1985 GT) and went to such lengths to keep it in top notch shape.  It was a privelage to drive it when I turned 16 and still is to drive such a beautiful car (64,000K).  I had wanted a Talon in 1999 but Dad talked me out of it and into a Fiero.  A ride in a V8 Fiero got me totally hooked!  And soon we found the 1988 GT (which instead of getting the V8 has remained practically 100% Stock!).  I now have 3 and the family is up to 12!<P><BR>Jennifer<BR>Silver 88 GT<BR>Silver 86 Cp<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT||||reg||1
Z||000038||FieroHeather||06-19-2001||10:31 PM||||I am a proud Fiero Passenger  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I dont have my own car yet--but I was looking into a nice rice ummm errr K-car the other day  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  *phew* got myself out of that one!<P>My fiancee (grinthock) had got me hooked on fieros when he got his first one 4 years ago.  I have sooooooo many awesome memories with that car and us two!  Now he has another one, and I think it is the sweetest thing around.  It sure eats the gas, but hey, ya cant have it all perfect, eh?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Welcome to the forum fierobaby!||||reg||7
